# .graphifyignore — force Graphify into 100% local tree-sitter AST mode (zero LLM tokens).
#
# Graphify has two extraction modes:
#   * code mode   -> local tree-sitter AST parsing + Leiden communities (free)
#   * doc mode    -> LLM-assisted semantic extraction for prose/images/notebooks (costs tokens)
# Everything that would be routed to doc mode is excluded here, so `graphify update`
# never touches a model. Contracts that live in code files (.d.ts, .py, .ts, .rs, .go)
# stay in the graph; prose contracts (OpenAPI YAML, JSON schemas) do not, which is why
# AGENTS.md allows a targeted Grep/Glob fallback for exactly those files.

# --- prose / documentation (doc mode) ---------------------------------------
*.md
*.mdx
*.markdown
*.rst
*.txt
*.adoc
*.tex
docs/
README*
CHANGELOG*
LICENSE*

# --- agent state, skills, prompts, reports -----------------------------------
.agents/
.claude/
.codex/
.github/
.obsidian/
IDEA.md
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# --- graphify's own output (never re-ingest) ---------------------------------
graphify-out/

# --- notebooks, images, pdfs (vision / doc mode) -----------------------------
*.ipynb
*.pdf
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.svg
*.webp
*.bmp
*.ico
*.html
*.htm

